Wrote the coder-3.json label file with one row for Shannon Grove on judicial-criminal-justice. SB 14 (her authored bill adding human trafficking of a minor to the serious-felony/Three Strikes list) was coded as `own-act`/`record`/`author`, `on-question`, `in-term`, but `direction-only` on V4 — it shows punitive direction without separating rungs 3/4/5, since the instrument is scoped to one specific crime rather than her general sentencing philosophy. Row resolves to BLANK `direction-only`.
